# Copy this file to anthropic-key.txt and paste your Anthropic API key on
# its own line (it starts with sk-ant-). Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
#   cp anthropic-key.txt.example anthropic-key.txt
#
# anthropic-key.txt is gitignored ON PURPOSE — never commit a real key:
# GitHub auto-revokes leaked Anthropic keys, and anyone with repo access
# could spend on your account. This file works for LOCAL runs only; the
# live Railway deployment reads the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY service variable.
#
# sk-ant-your-key-here
